## 📦 **Trade-offs for Speed and Functionality**

### ✅ **Speed Considerations**

| Feature | Trade-off | Recommendation |
|--------|-----------|----------------|
| **Database Storage** | May slow down page load | Use a lightweight backend (e.g., Firebase, Express) |
| **Real-time Updates** | May require server-side processing | Use WebSockets or push notifications if needed |
| **Local In-memory Storage** | Fast but not persistent | Use localStorage for small data, or a backend for persistence |
| **Changelog Display** | May be slow if too many changes | Use pagination or lazy loading for large datasets |

### ✅ **Functionality Considerations**

| Feature | Trade-off | Recommendation |
|--------|-----------|----------------|
| **Edit History** | Can be slow to load | Use a lightweight JS library (e.g., `history.js`) |
| **User Editing** | May require server-side validation | Provide a simple text editor or use a CMS |
| **Searchable Changelog** | Adds complexity | Use a search feature with filters |
| **Responsive Design** | May reduce performance | Use a lightweight CSS framework (e.g., Bootstrap) |

---

